{
  "_comment": [
    "THE CREATOR TUNER'S SITE LIST AND ITS SENTENCES (CREATOR_TUNER.md rev 3, sec 3.4 and 5).",
    "One file read by both sides: CreatorGalleryHarmonic on the server and harmonic_model.js in the",
    "builder, so the list and the words cannot drift apart. A pattern is matched against",
    "host + path + query of the normalized link, anchored at both ends by each reader; host is",
    "matched against the host alone. A post pattern's profile names its groups as \\1, \\2.",
    "A site's canonical rules rewrite another spelling of one page to the one the Tuner stores,",
    "before its posts and accept patterns are tried: the first matching rule, its groups as \\1,",
    "\\2. One page has one link, so a removal of it covers every spelling (sec 4.5).",
    "A site taken off this list stops its harmonics drawing and counting at once; the rows stay,",
    "so putting it back restores them (sec 4.6)."
  ],
